{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [\n    \"evidence:source:35c41703812eb679e8c8b4c503690ae5b1ecc7b95d2643163a96ae1c016d27d2\",\n    \"evidence:source:f17758b91395ba7ce7339162e3a8de3e1d2e268e80f5c10e2b0af4554e46bd3c\",\n    \"evidence:source:d7a688391e28231c21325fab8db56be021368c494f904ceb04ef9db207f77735\",\n    \"evidence:source:db97597a305a74992da8b2e02ee70017186d03e065a1a1e911865d0f1031d5b8\",\n    \"evidence:source:b2266d63f39acabb1907296eea765c6e5042f59bbb814bba1a7b3c8238cb9b3d\",\n    \"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\",\n    \"evidence:source:f51011f85a2bea698ff3b96318145bf9359cf91d77a6713ac8c773748b59932c\",\n    \"evidence:source:01641c9d9065e195a70d8624d53e9e6b5e6df8a2d048009ebcdeecb49c7f6e84\",\n    \"evidence:source:fffe4ca0578e1c5423076449091396f16013918e83d85b223fbc525bd4341e39\",\n    \"evidence:source:a0ccda919261d50457b464263a4c2a8d0c5d67ffec9baf8ff110173c85f43355\",\n    \"evidence:source:c717f77783e1c554637400c26db54f1c6aa0cba6ac008e377cf200e48db8debe\"\n  ],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk-2-1-001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究理论依据\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk-2-1-002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本研究的实际适应症为特发性肺纤维化（IPF）。拟研究的干预为抗纤维化小分子口服药物。该理论依据应围绕IPF试验参与者逐项说明临床问题、标准治疗（SOC）、未满足需求及本研究的证据缺口。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk-2-1-003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：特发性肺纤维化在本研究目标人群中的当前疾病负担与治疗困境（包括疾病进展、症状负担及临床管理难点）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk-2-1-004\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：特发性肺纤维化当前标准治疗（SOC）的项目化、可核查描述（包括治疗药物或非药物干预、适用阶段及依据来源）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk-2-1-005\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：特发性肺纤维化试验参与者尚未满足的临床需求（需具体到本适应症人群，而非泛化描述）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk-2-1-006\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：本研究拟解决的、现有证据无法回答的不确定性（需说明抗纤维化小分子口服药物在特发性肺纤维化中的证据缺口，并区分于通用疾病介绍）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk-2-1-007\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"在上述实际适应症已确认的前提下，临床问题、标准治疗、未满足需求和证据缺口四项均待补充；待逐项确认后，本研究理论依据方可形成完整的五段式论证。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"c36f76eba5e2f7c6d1d1016be02f2fe9425c38ac96b94bc50a26a0e3d4589756"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:bd6c05acb5ef00625f862861d25f38c3e6d22636097cc13511c37d0f13cd150e:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:bd6c05acb5ef00625f862861d25f38c3e6d22636097cc13511c37d0f13cd150e:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-latest-cloud","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"67d86893cba90fb9afff8f0b1908afaaa6114cb930a0d19bc71108d8d5144432","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf7be0e09db8863e","provider_session_id":"993328e3-89ad-4f4e-a848-871c58e708d5","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}